{"id":"vod_bf_22993","vodId":"22993","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"迷茫管家与懦弱的我","name_cn":"迷茫管家与懦弱的我","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/aeeea46928109a54d2d372edcc5b0be2.jpg"},"summary":"近卫昂（井口裕香 配音）家世世代代都作为凉月家的管家而存在，以此与凉月家族形成了深厚的羁绊。可是，管家的职位只能由男子担当，为了延续祖先的传统，近卫昂女扮男装隐藏身份，成为了大小姐凉月奏（喜多村英梨 配音）的管家。　　坂町近次郎是一个普通的男生，由于童年的遭遇，长大后的次郎开始变得无法从容的面对女性，这一现象一般被称为“女性恐惧症”。由于这种特质，次郎发现了近卫昂的秘密，为了掩盖事实，凉月奏以治疗其恐惧症为条件，要求次郎保守这个秘密。从此，在害怕女性的次郎身边，开始出没大量外形可爱性格活泼的女生，次郎快乐的校园生活正式开始！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 02:24:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/mimangguanjiayunuoruodewo/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/vi